<title>USA: St. Joseph Light &amp; Power Co Q1 net lower.</title>
<headline>St. Joseph Light &amp; Power Co Q1 net lower.</headline>
<dateline>ST. JOSEPH, Mo. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			$  0.25		   $ 0.27</p>
<p> Net			  1,991		    2,142</p>
<p> Revs			23,510		   23,619</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,940		    7,822</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 1.29		  $  1.33</p>
<p> Net			 10,206		   10,378</p>
<p> Revs			95,761		   94,340</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,897		    7,815</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Lower 1997 Q1 results earnings and revenues reflect impact of warmer than normal temperatures which reduced both electric and gas sales when compared with 1996 quarter.</p>
<p>Per share results restated for two-for-one stock split in July 1996.</p>
<p>		 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
